## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Key Architectural Decisions & Standards:**
> 1. **Framework & Stack**: Next.js 15 App Router with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide React icons, and HTML5 Web Audio API for edge decibel telemetry.
> 2. **Map & Routing**: Custom high-fidelity interactive vector map engine with realistic road geometry, pulsing geofenced virtual pickup spots, and smooth animated vehicle motion along routes.
> 3. **Gemini Macro-Routing**: Dual-mode engine: connects to Gemini 1.5 Flash structured output via `@google/genai` when `GEMINI_API_KEY` is present, with a built-in deterministic geometric K-means & Voronoi clustering algorithm with $<150\text{m}$ walking distance constraints as a zero-config fallback.
> 4. **Edge Audio Safety**: Uses the browser's native Web Audio API to calculate continuous root-mean-square (RMS) decibels, with a "Simulate Disturbance" control allowing instant live demo evaluation without needing to scream into microphones.
> 5. **Offline Mesh & IndexedDB**: Real IndexedDB storage with an offline toggle switch ("Simulate Cellular Dead Zone") to demonstrate peer-to-peer boarding pass verification and automatic sync-queue playback upon reconnection.
> 6. **Role Switcher & Interactive Roadmap**: A sleek top-bar controller enabling one-click switching between Commuter, Driver, Enterprise HR, Dispatcher Ops, and the 6-Week Sprint Roadmap viewer.

